        </div>
        <p class="quote">&ldquo;If a claim here is wrong, an issue with a primary source is more useful than almost anything else.&rdquo;</p>
        <p class="colophon">Research pass 2026-09-02. Implementation and measurement 2026-09-05. Research and documentation CC-BY-4.0; code MIT. No model weights and no generated Indian-language audio ship. Voice engine for these clips: Qwen3-TTS, Apache-2.0. <a href={links.repo}>github.com/PranavMishra17/alaap</a></p>
      </footer>
